hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1549","On the authority of Issa bin Ibrahim Al-Ghafiqi, on the authority of Ibn Wahb, on the authority of Muawiyah bin Salih, on the authority of Abu Al-Zahiriyah, on the authority of Kathir ibn Murrah, on the authority of Abd God Ibn Omar, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Whoever joins a line, God will connect him, and whoever breaks a line, God will cut him off.”"
